Fixed on `comebin-optimizations-v11` @ **`41606c8`** — COMEBin now reports **0 bins and exits 0** instead of raising, and the pipeline no longer dies with `Clustering exited with status 1`.

### Root cause
`auxiliary/test_getmarker_2quarter.pl` uses distinct exit codes to say "I could not build a usable seed set": `2` (no marker hit matches a contig), `3` (hits mapped, but no gene passes the completeness/coverage gate), `4` (no marker hits at all). `gen_seed()` treated every non-zero status as a hard tool failure, so a perfectly ordinary *empty result* — your case, `status 3` — was escalated t
